<title>USA: MBIA approves Detroit convention center bonds.</title>
<headline>MBIA approves Detroit convention center bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Monday it approved for secondary market insurance Detroit, Mich., convention facility limited tax revenue bonds, for Cobo Hall.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
